When working on this repository, you MUST follow these instructions:
1. Write tests for all new changes.
2. Verify the user has validated the changes.
3. Commit and push the new changes.
4. NEVER claim or state that tests pass unless you have explicitly run the test command and verified the complete test run output yourself.
5. NEVER run more than one Playwright test process concurrently at a time.
6. Run `npm run deploy` to publish the new changes to GitHub Pages.
